{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"candidate","failure_reason":"","missing_public_schema_fields":[],"task_id":"82e2fac_1","task_family":"82e2fac","completion_mode":"answer_variable","plan_summary":"Inspect the required public APIs, authenticate with Supervisor-provided credentials, exhaustively paginate the Spotify playlist library, retrieve every unique referenced song, derive the unique highest-like-count title, and submit that answer.","steps":[{"step_index":1,"phase":"inspect","reasoning":"The public API documentation must be inspected before making the first task API call, including authentication, data retrieval, and completion interfaces.","action_code":"api_docs = {\n    \"supervisor.show_profile\": apis.supervisor.show_profile.__doc__,\n    \"supervisor.show_account_passwords\": apis.supervisor.show_account_passwords.__doc__,\n    \"spotify.login\": apis.spotify.login.__doc__,\n    \"spotify.show_playlist_library\": apis.spotify.show_playlist_library.__doc__,\n    \"spotify.show_song\": apis.spotify.show_song.__doc__,\n    \"supervisor.complete_task\": apis.supervisor.complete_task.__doc__,\n}\nfor api_name, api_doc in api_docs.items():\n    print(api_name, api_doc)","depends_on_steps":[],"api_names_used":["supervisor.show_profile","supervisor.show_account_passwords","spotify.login","spotify.show_playlist_library","spotify.show_song","supervisor.complete_task"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Public documentation for every required API is available before task API use"],"output_policy":"public_records"},{"step_index":2,"phase":"observe","reasoning":"Authentication inputs must come from Supervisor APIs and secret values must remain unprinted.","action_code":"supervisor_profile = apis.supervisor.show_profile()\naccount_password_records = apis.supervisor.show_account_passwords()","depends_on_steps":[1],"api_names_used":["supervisor.show_profile","supervisor.show_account_passwords"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Supervisor profile and account-password records are saved in variables"],"output_policy":"no_print"},{"step_index":3,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"Select the Spotify credential from the observed account records and use the observed profile email as the login username without exposing the password.","action_code":"spotify_password_matches = [record[\"password\"] for record in account_password_records if record[\"account_name\"].strip().lower() == \"spotify\"]\nif len(spotify_password_matches) != 1:\n    raise ValueError(\"Expected exactly one Spotify account credential\")\nspotify_username = supervisor_profile[\"email\"]\nspotify_password = spotify_password_matches[0]","depends_on_steps":[2],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Exactly one Spotify credential is selected","Username and password are derived solely from Supervisor results"],"output_policy":"no_print"},{"step_index":4,"phase":"authenticate","reasoning":"The Spotify access token is required to read the authenticated user's playlist library.","action_code":"spotify_login_response = apis.spotify.login(username=spotify_username, password=spotify_password)\nspotify_access_token = spotify_login_response[\"access_token\"]","depends_on_steps":[3],"api_names_used":["spotify.login"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Spotify login response supplies an access token stored without printing it"],"output_policy":"no_print"},{"step_index":5,"phase":"observe","reasoning":"All playlist-library pages must be read because any playlist may reference the most-liked song.","action_code":"playlist_pages = []\npage_index = 0\nwhile True:\n    playlist_page = apis.spotify.show_playlist_library(access_token=spotify_access_token, page_index=page_index)\n    if not playlist_page:\n        break\n    playlist_pages.append(playlist_page)\n    page_index += 1\nplaylists = [playlist for page in playlist_pages for playlist in page]\nprint({\"playlist_count\": len(playlists), \"pages_read\": len(playlist_pages)})","depends_on_steps":[4],"api_names_used":["spotify.show_playlist_library"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Pagination continues until the first empty page","All returned playlists are retained"],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":6,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"Deduplicate the song identifiers observed across all playlists so each relevant song is retrieved once.","action_code":"song_ids = sorted({song_id for playlist in playlists for song_id in playlist[\"song_ids\"]})\nif not song_ids:\n    raise ValueError(\"No songs were found in the playlist library\")\nprint({\"unique_song_count\": len(song_ids)})","depends_on_steps":[5],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Song identifiers come only from observed playlist records","At least one playlist song is available for comparison"],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":7,"phase":"observe","reasoning":"Like counts and titles are available from individual song records, so every unique playlist song must be retrieved.","action_code":"songs = []\nfor song_id in song_ids:\n    songs.append(apis.spotify.show_song(song_id=song_id))\nprint({\"songs_loaded\": len(songs)})","depends_on_steps":[6],"api_names_used":["spotify.show_song"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["A public song record is loaded for every unique playlist song identifier"],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":8,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"Compute the maximum observed song like count and require a unique matching record before deriving the singular title requested by the instruction.","action_code":"highest_like_count = max(song[\"like_count\"] for song in songs)\nmost_liked_songs = [song for song in songs if song[\"like_count\"] == highest_like_count]\nprint({\"candidate_songs\": [{\"song_id\": song[\"song_id\"], \"title\": song[\"title\"], \"like_count\": song[\"like_count\"]} for song in most_liked_songs]})\nif len(most_liked_songs) != 1:\n    raise ValueError(\"The most-liked playlist song is not unique\")\nanswer = most_liked_songs[0][\"title\"]","depends_on_steps":[7],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Maximum like count is computed from retrieved song records","Exactly one song has the maximum like count","Answer is that song's observed title"],"output_policy":"public_records"},{"step_index":9,"phase":"complete","reasoning":"The answer variable has been derived from the exhaustively retrieved public Spotify records, so the QA task can now be completed.","action_code":"completion_response = apis.supervisor.complete_task(answer=answer)","depends_on_steps":[8],"api_names_used":["supervisor.complete_task"],"mutates_state":true,"verification_targets":["Computed title is submitted as the task answer"],"output_policy":"no_print"}]}